  "description": "Traded this company a few times...but a longer term trend appears to have formed.",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only🔒 </strong></em>stock pick. This ticker has been on my radar through 2024. A few good trades, 1 trade was a failure. This company has consistently been held back with negative macro news, the latest being Tariffs. However, the weekly pivot breakout provides<strong> a high probability of a continued upward trend. </strong></p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><p>Full disclosure, this will mark the 5th trade with this company. Of the 4 trades, 2 were successful, 1 break even and 1 unsuccessful. <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$GE&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> is naturally a tumultuous ticker. The tariff scares pulled it back, but it has since regained that pullback, plus some. However, the longer the consolidation, the longer the breakout is. GE has been consolidating since approximately April 2024, and has shown a breakout on both the weekly and daily timeframes. The first signal came on 15 May from our stock screener…however I wanted to see a retest.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png\" width=\"1331\" height=\"797\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:797,&quot;width&quot;:1331,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:94112,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/164718532?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mwlZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F72681f6d-4f1c-4a34-877d-9eed03549d6b_1331x797.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-wi